Package: postcodElapse
Title: Estimate air pollution concentrations for Dutch postcodes using ELAPSE.
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: 
    person("Berend", "Veldthuis", , "b.veldthuis@umcg.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Berend Veldthuis [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Berend Veldthuis <b.veldthuis@umcg.nl>
Description: Calculate estimated concentration of PM2.5, BC, NO2, O3 air
  pollutants for Duch postal addreses. Air pollution data is extracted from the 
  ELAPSE model published by K de Hoogh. Locations of postal codes are queryed 
  from the Basisregistratie Adressen en Gebouwen or Postcode6 databases.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
